"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫I’m staring into "
"a pair of ruby red eyes, open wide with shock.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫I recall snapping at him, "
"insulting him, but I don’t remember what I said.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Nor do I remember how he "
"responded.⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫All I know is that a wave of churning blackness appeared out of "
"nowhere, ⟪k:24⟫washing me away.⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫I’m powerless.⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫Helpless.⟪k:31⟫"
"⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫Hopeless.⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫My young mind sucked into it like a whirlpool."
