"⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫“You don’t know that. ⟪k:18⟫Your arms look much better than before.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫It "
"won’t be long before your face starts healing too.”⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫“The ointment isn’t free. "
"⟪k:24⟫You’re wasting your money.”⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫“It’s my money. I can use it however I please. "
"So just shut up and let me do this.”⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫“You’re a very obnoxious man, you "
"know.”⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫“What was that? You want me to rub it in ⟪k:34⟫real hard⟪k:35⟫, "
"huh?”⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫“Fine...”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_44551E5A_FE36_4981_BA52_B63592A3B670
