"I would establish a new church, have it be run by a nun the city had been fawning over for some "
"time—they called her “the Saintess.” ⟪k:6⟫There, I would take the witch’s blood and call it a "
"miracle medicine, distributing it in exchange for tithes, which the people would certainly come "
"for in droves. ⟪k:7⟫And if the blood somehow ⟪k:8⟫did⟪k:9⟫ happen to have special powers, then "
"that would make the scheme that much more effective."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2B4B117D_5E12_4E2C_A09D_BE44913A6A03
