"pain.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Although, whether what I’m looking at could be said to resemble a “human” "
"is a difficult question.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫It’s a hazy, indistinct shape, ⟪k:16⟫on the precipice "
