msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6EDDA1CB_F4CC_477D_AB58_9A8B01666872"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Did I do the same thing to him... ⟪k:1⟫that Morgana did to me?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Was it I who "
"summoned the darkness?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Who laid his past bare.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Who forced him to "
"relive those events, ⟪k:11⟫to experience once more everything he felt, everything he thought."
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Who put him through that despair a second time.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫I can only "
"imagine how he must have felt... ⟪k:18⟫causing someone he once cared for so much pain.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫"
"⟪k:21⟫The things he did are abhorrent, more than deserving of reproach—⟪k:22⟫and it would "
"undoubtedly be easier for him to simply vanish into the eternal abyss."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Did I do the same thing to him... ⟪k:1⟫that Morgana did to me?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Was it I who "
"summoned the darkness?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Who laid his past bare.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Who forced him to "
"relive those events, ⟪k:11⟫to experience once more everything he felt, everything he thought."
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Who put him through that despair a second time.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫I can only "
"imagine how he must have felt... ⟪k:18⟫causing someone he once cared for so much pain.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫"
"⟪k:21⟫The things he did are abhorrent, more than deserving of reproach—⟪k:22⟫and it would "
"undoubtedly be easier for him to simply vanish into the eternal abyss."

